* Stuck raindrops cleared (openc2e Creatures 2 project, our own script;
* owner's screenshot, 2026-11-22: a raindrop frozen against a rock by the
* west sea for some time). Run by openc2e after the world loads (Additions
* folder); made anew each load.
* any world: it changes objects by kind, not Eden's map, so it runs on every
* world (other Additions run only on worlds started from Eden.sfc).
*
* The clouds (2 14 1) make raindrops (2 14 3) that fall until they land;
* script-patches.txt has them go on any landing. A drop held still some
* other way (resting on an object, caught where no collision is reported)
* would stay. A watcher (2 1 166, every 25 ticks) removes a raindrop that
* has not moved since its last look. A falling drop moves every tick.
* OV60, OV61: where it was at the last look; OV62 1 once seen once.
enum 2 1 166 kill targ next
inst new: simp blnk 1 0 0 0 setv cls2 2 1 166 setv attr 16 mvto 5000 1350 tick 25 slow
scrp 2 1 166 9
  inst
  enum 2 14 3
    doif ov62 eq 1 and posl eq ov60 and post eq ov61
      kill targ
    else
      setv ov60 posl
      setv ov61 post
      setv ov62 1
    endi
  next
endm
